  "bodyHash": "Wc6eTK+YXeY=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\">（我的第一個模組/資料包）</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_a926bc6e-7202-4d5d-b3ec-ad14554db92e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"808\" height=\"361\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Epic Samurai、Epic Knights、Dungeon Weapons、Born in Chaos、Simply Swords 及其他多種模組武器與 Epic Fight、Weapons of Miracles、Epic Fight Battle Styles 及其他附加元件的相容性。</strong></h3><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>還有更多！EFM 相容的全新軌跡紋理！<br></strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">預期可搭配使用</span></span></span>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">以及獲得完整體驗所必需的依賴項</span>）：</h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/881/915/638312712562327674.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> 由 maninthe_home/yesman 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/884/152/638318074504658168.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles</a>（wom）由 reascer 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/915/178/638372918905326451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Battle Styles</a>（ef-bs）由 Forixaim 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/862/853/638271674802985984.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight - 關刀動作集</a>（falchionmoveset）由 namelesslk 製作</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請檢查附加檔案以下載資源包，以修復並加入新紋理。</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>（在我找到方法將其內建於資料包之前，這將是取得紋理包的方式）</strong></p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_20d558b2-164b-4554-937a-789442eeaa53.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"721\" height=\"384\"></strong></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">推薦：</h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/963/317/638461000018381994.png\" alt=\"標誌\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight x Iron's Spells 裝甲修復</a> 由 cacheing 製作</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">此資料包/模組是為了讓 Epic Fight 能與各種模組相容而製作。根據個人喜好更改武器的動作集，歡迎依個人喜好修改。</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>嘗試自己的戰鬥風格：</strong></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">如何為 Epic Fight 製作自訂武器與裝甲的資料包：</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f%2523onetwo-handed-weapon-file\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://epicfight-docs.readthedocs.io/Guides/page2/#onetwo-handed-weapon-file</a></h4><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">武器來源：</h2><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/778/486/638122554849559119.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born In Chaos</a> 由 mongoose_artist 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/805/606/638172713304550451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Samurai</a> 由 VeroxUniverse 製作</h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/411/944/637630777607986862.png\" alt=\"Epic Knights\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights</a>/magistuarmory 由 magistu_ 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/789/196/638143347801778495.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Weapons</a> 由 thespringaling 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/611/576/637996129346404798.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Simply Swords</a> 由 sweenuss 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/190/975/636857615673605328.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍</a> 由 sbom_xela 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/937/893/638416517376113534.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC 地下城武器</a> 由 chronos_sacaria 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/892/693/638335183690820532.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights 附加元件</a> 由 magistu_ 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/464/755/637744772991786976.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae</a> 由 Obscuria 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/897/696/638342973699298752.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabled </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weaponry</a> 由 DaddyUnion 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/396/11/637595005615179370.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事</a> 由 verctorwing 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/871/265/638288661913483053.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a> 由 Iron431 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/460/870/637739722679428303.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 's Cataclysm</a> 由 mcl_ender 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/506/233/637824423557821613.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reliquary Reincarnations</a> 由 P3pp3rF1y 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/258/931/637209858883035931.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\">吸血鬼：成為吸血鬼！</a> 由 maxanier 和 Cheaterpaul 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/566/189/637924794889476652.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dave's Potioneering</a> 由 SoterDave 製作</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天堂</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a>由 TheAetherTeam 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/883/158/638315999771583464.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Basic Weapons</a> 由 Khazoda 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/838/790/638231371029924457.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomancy</a> 由 Elenterius 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/241/891/637131079632015619.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">藍天</a> 由 ModdingLegacy 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/798/638390956074205375.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/851/638391125861006765.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus:Arcane</a> 由 Nokunami 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/834/456/638225202891768109.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/889/312/638328880372078491.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Paladins</a> &amp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(38, 38, 38)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Empires</a> 由 VeroxUniverse 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/772/533/638112628921999420.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁忌的奧秘</a> 由 cesar_zorak 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/761/310/638097611993061146.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knave's Needs</a> 由 KodoDenka 製作</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/796/600/638156948581632807.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 武器庫</a> 作者：Icy0x1</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/555/994/637900334510568136.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">-RPG 風格</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">武器！</a> 作者：zrikon</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/614/129/637997268560849585.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡單武器，更佳戰鬥</a><em> &lt;s&gt;（現已支援史詩戰鬥！）&lt;/s&gt;&nbsp;</em>作者：InfernalEclipse</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/14/212/635589178760357568.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a> 作者：Benimatic</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/280/925/637283672869883111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">地下花園</a> 作者：Quek04</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/679/638025764121686580.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界強化</a> 作者：praizazdd7724（僅適用於1.8版本）</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/887/654/638325263575103332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">EEEAB 的生物</a> 作者：EEEAB</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>未來還會有更多！...</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">其他相容性：</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/825/222/638210773187460598.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民招募</a> 作者：talhanation</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/896/228/638341222431292689.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">遊戲遺物 續篇</a>（僅修改了足跡）作者：power282</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">資料包由 <strong>ElC4</strong> 製作，並由 Йохан Петрович 協助，參考了其他資料包如：</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-simplyswords with epicfight（sunwoolove777 製作）</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-epic-knights-EFM（來自史詩騎士 Discord 伺服器）</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">問與答</h1><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>你可以加入這個模組 [插入任何武器模組] 嗎？</strong></h4><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>我知道評論區建議的模組，一旦我有時間開發這個模組，我會測試它們與史詩戰鬥的相容性。有些模組如 Weapons Masters 有自己的戰鬥機制，強制其與史詩戰鬥相容會造成混亂，因此需要先進行測試。</em></h5><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">這是我第一個資料包/模組，可以說我是直接跳進一個大池子裡，卻不知道怎麼正確游泳。我對 Java 不太了解，也還不明白它如何與 Minecraft 模組運作，但我正在學習。而且我是學生，有時會忙於其他事務，大部分空閒時間也在玩其他遊戲，希望你能理解。</p>\n<p>另外，如果拼寫有誤，請見諒，因為我的母語不是英語。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
